#. ~ Description of "155mm M712 HEAT"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "A 155mm High Explosive Anti Tank round, normally laser-guided.  Separate-loading, it comes with the requisite fuze installed, a propellant bag, and percussion primer.  As its guidance feature requires a laser designator and has a minimum range of 3 kilometers, using it for direct fire is an astounding display of overkill."
msgstr ""

