#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "155mm M795 frag"
msgid_plural "155mm M795 frag"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. ~ Description of "155mm M795 frag"
#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "A 155mm High Explosive Fragmentation round.  Separate-loading, it comes with the requisite fuze installed, a propellant bag, and percussion primer.  Designed to lob a heavy shell a long distance, using it direct-fire isn't exactly ideal, but it'll still give anything near what you hit a seriously bad time."
msgstr ""

