#: ..\cdda-tankmod-revived-mod\Tankmod_Revived\items.json
msgid "A makeshift separate-loading shotshell for 155mm.  Consists of a canister of lead balls, a bag of propellant, and a replacement primer.  Effectively turns a howitzer into a punt gun on steroids."
msgstr ""

